A Kubernetes cluster is under memory pressure and the kubelet must evict pods. Three pods run on the node with these resource specs. Which pod is evicted **first**, and what QoS classes do these specs produce?

```yaml
# Pod A
resources:
  requests: { cpu: "250m", memory: "256Mi" }
  limits:   { cpu: "250m", memory: "256Mi" }

# Pod B
resources:
  requests: { cpu: "250m", memory: "256Mi" }
  limits:   { cpu: "500m", memory: "512Mi" }

# Pod C
# (no resources block at all)
```
